{
  "about": {
    "source": "hand-made for column rights: a field only one role reads (field.access.read), one two roles read and one writes (read + write), a read-time computed field over the hidden one, an aggregate that folds the hidden field and a list of the same table; definition and data model stored as the canonicalizers write them",
